<title>USA: U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soymeal export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 209,800 MT were four and one-half times the week earlier and four times the 4-week average.  The principal buyers were Malaysia (31,300 MT), Italy (28,000 MT), Venezuela (25,400 MT), Australia (24,300 MT), and the Philippines (20,000 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 166,100 MT were up 13 percent from the previous week, but were 5 percent below the 4-week average.  The Philippines 56,000 MT), Malaysia (31,300 MT), Venezuela (19,900 MT), and Australia (17,100 MT) were the major recipients.</p>
</text>
